. **# Dealer shock: portfolio-weighted CDS shock, dealer x day
. 
. use `shocks', clear

. gen qtr = qofd(date)

. joinby qtr using `dealer_w'

. gen dshock = shareDE*shockDE + shareFR*shockFR + shareIT*shockIT + shareES*shockES

. keep dealer_id date dshock

. tempfile dealershock

. save `dealershock'
